OL,3,GNEWSA'Being able to stay in hospital
OL,4,Awith our son meant everything'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple says being able to stay in
OL,7,Fhospital with their premature baby son
OL,8,Fbefore he died "meant everything" to
OL,9,Fthem. Sixteen months on from Alfred's
OL,10,Fdeath, a concert will be held in his
OL,11,Fmemory to raise funds to help families
OL,12,Fgoing through similar circumstances.
OL,14,FBaby Alfred, who weighed 1lb 12oz
OL,15,F(0.79kg) at birth, spent 144 days
OL,16,Freceiving neonatal care at Bradford
OL,17,FRoyal Infirmary.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
