OL,3,GNEWSA'Being able to stay in hospital
OL,4,Awith our son meant everything'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis parents Louise Gee and Ben Clay
OL,7,Fwere able to stay in one of two family
OL,8,Frooms on the ward, allowing them to
OL,9,Fremain together as a family before he
OL,10,Fdied on 29 May 2025.
OL,12,FThe charity concert on Saturday is
OL,13,Fraising funds for additional bedrooms
OL,14,Ffor families to stay close to their
OL,15,Fbabies during their time on the
OL,16,Fneonatal unit.
